{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Please don’t wake me tonight while I’m [F]sleepin
[F]For I might have the [G]same dream [C]again
[Bb]Let me own the whole world for just a [F]moment
[F]While I hold you in my [C]arms once [F]again
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Last night I had a [Bb]dream about you [F]darlin
[F]Happy tears filled my [G]eyes when I held [C]you
[F]When I awoke and [Bb]realized I was [F]dreamin
[F]Happy tears that filled [C]my eyes [F]had turned to blue
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Instrumental}
[F] [Bb] [F] [C] [F]
